WEBVTT

00:05:29.969 --> 00:05:33.424
the means of artistic production
have been democratized

00:05:33.448 --> 00:05:36.172
for the first time
in all of human history.

00:05:37.223 --> 00:05:39.676
In the 1930s, if any of you wanted
to make a movie,

00:05:39.700 --> 00:05:41.976
you had to work for
Warner Brothers or RKO,

00:05:42.000 --> 00:05:43.976
because who could afford a movie set

00:05:44.000 --> 00:05:46.096
and lighting equipment
and editing equipment

00:05:46.120 --> 00:05:47.903
and scoring, and more?

00:05:47.927 --> 00:05:51.106
And now who in this room
doesn't know a 14 year-old

00:05:51.130 --> 00:05:53.661
hard at work on her second,
third, or fourth movie?

00:05:53.685 --> 00:05:55.480
(Laughter)

00:05:55.504 --> 00:05:58.588
Similarly, the means
of artistic distribution

00:05:58.612 --> 00:06:01.393
have been democratized
for the first time in human history.